## Overview

This is a compilation of work from 2021–22, during my Bachelor of Design at IIT Guwahati: course assignments, work for the Ishanya design festival, and a few personal pieces. The Warps stills also appeared in this compilation, and they have [their own page](/work/warps-3d-motion).

## Illustration and book design

For a visual narrative course, we each chose a folk tale from our region and made it into a storybook. I illustrated "The Test", from the Naranathu Bhranthan stories, in warm, painterly tones.

{% gallery columns=2 %}
![Opening spread of The Test](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/folktale-spread-1.webp)

![The opening spread in a printed book mockup](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/folktale-mockup-1.webp)

![Closing spread with two figures](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/folktale-spread-2.webp)

![The closing spread in a printed book mockup](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/folktale-mockup-2.webp)
{% /gallery %}

I designed a book cover for an assignment in a cognitive ergonomics course.

{% gallery columns=2 %}
