## 3D and animation

Two 3D still scenes, each shown alongside its untextured version: "Order and Chaos" and "Where Art meets Aesthetics".

![Order and Chaos, rendered and as a clay model](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/order-and-chaos.webp "Order and Chaos")

![Where Art meets Aesthetics, rendered and as a wireframe](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/where-art-meets-aesthetics.webp "Where Art meets Aesthetics")

Breaking Bird was an animated short made by seven students in the visual narrative course. I was on the 3D animation team, and these are shots I worked on.

{% gallery columns=3 %}
![Low-poly autumn forest](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/breaking-bird-forest.webp)

![Breaking Bird title card](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/breaking-bird-title.webp)

![A small figure among tall trees](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/breaking-bird-trees.webp)

![A flock of birds against a red wash](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/breaking-bird-flock.webp)

![A bird on a ground of line-drawn leaves](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/breaking-bird-leaves.webp)

![Grey trees under a red sky](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/breaking-bird-red-sky.webp)
{% /gallery %}

An expressive word animation for a typography assignment.

![The word ARROW animating into an arrow shape](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/arrow-word-animation.webp "Typography assignment")

## Ishanya 2022

Ishanya is the national design festival at IIT Guwahati, and I was on its creatives core team in 2022. I worked on the 2D animation in the theme teaser.

{% gallery columns=3 %}
![Teaser frame with a falling shape](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/ishanya-teaser-1.webp)

![Teaser frame with the Unheard theme](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/ishanya-teaser-2.webp)

![Teaser end frame, Ishanya 2022](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/ishanya-teaser-3.webp)
{% /gallery %}

We also made exhibition panel templates for the graduating students' thesis projects and set up a virtual exhibition for them in Mozilla Hubs.

{% gallery columns=2 %}
![Virtual exhibition entrance](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/virtual-exhibition-entrance.webp)

![Thesis panels along a curved wall](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/virtual-exhibition-gallery.webp)

![The main exhibition hall](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/virtual-exhibition-hall.webp)

![A single thesis panel up close](/work/miscellaneous-2021-22/virtual-exhibition-panel.webp)
{% /gallery %}

## Notes

Looking back, this year was about trying every medium I could. Painting, 3D, 2D animation and icon work each taught me something I later used in brand work.
